data: {"id": "6fb7297d215f4ae5-thinking-parallel_evidence-500", "run_id": "6fb7297d215f4ae5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突和缺口\n\n**实体身份确认**\n- Pod `workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx` 位于 `aiops-case-07` 命名空间，UID `52361280-45fe-4ec1-a8f0-292e82b90b8c`，调度在 `node2`。\n\n**支持 CrashLoopBackOff 的事实**\n- **状态**：kubectl get 显示 STATUS 为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，重启次数 16 次。\n- **事件**：kubectl describe 和 events 均显示 kubelet 报告 `Back-off restarting failed container app`，警告重复 268 次。\n- **容器状态**：describe 摘要显示主容器 `app` 处于崩溃重启循环中，Reason 明确标记为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n\n**证据缺口（关键歧义）**\n- **无启动日志**：未采集到 `kubectl logs` 或 `previous logs`，缺失导致 CrashLoopBackOff 的", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788447578963, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

