data: {"id": "6fb7297d215f4ae5-final", "run_id": "6fb7297d215f4ae5", "seq": 505, "ts_ms": 1788447594959, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器反复重启且 HTTP 服务返回 500 错误。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff ... Back-off restarting failed container app` (over 60m) | 确认容器崩溃触发 Kubelet 的退避重启机制 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason: Error`, `exit_code: 78` | 确认容器因应用层错误非正常退出 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `ERROR CONFIG_MISSING` at `/work`, HTTP Status 500, `service: aiops-lab-workload` (8 occurrences) | 揭示应用崩溃的直接原因为配置缺失 |\n| 4 | Tracing | Deepflow/Tempo | Span: `GET /work`, HTTP Status 500, `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit` | 验证请求失败的具体路径及模式，并关联到同一组 `trace_id` |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (CrashLoopBackOff), `restarts_total` = 16 | 量化观察窗内的重启频率与当前停滞状态 |\n\n**证据互证说明：**\n证据 2（Exit Code 78）与证据 3（CONFIG_MISSING 日志）及证据 4（`config_missing_exit` Span）形成闭环，证明异常源于应用启动/运行逻辑中的硬编码错误而非资源调度。证据 1（K8s Event）与证据 5（Prometheus Metrics）从调度器与采集器视角，交叉确认了该异常导致的 CrashLoopBackOff 现象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用启动/运行配置缺失 (CONFIG_MISSING) → 应用进程捕获错误并退出 (Exit Code 78) → 直接失败 → Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，HTTP 服务持续返回 500\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：应用代码存在硬编码缺陷，在处理 `/work` 请求时因缺失必要配置（`CONFIG_MISSING`）主动终止进程。\n\n该配置缺失导致应用进程以 `Exit Code 78` 异常退出。Kubernetes 调度器检测到该退出后，触发指数退避重启策略（Back-off），导致容器反复重启且无法进入 Running 状态。证据 3（日志中的 `CONFIG_MISSING`）与证据 4（Tracing 中的 `config_missing_exit` 模式）为直接定性证据。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 40.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx: 40.8s (Evidence 33.4s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 67.339, "metrics": {"run_id": "6fb7297d215f4ae5", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 67.351717710495, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 67351.717710495, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 62457.1475982666, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 12126.484632492065, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4455.3542137146}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17979.3484210968, "success": tru